      "content": "i know i should check with my doctor but they are so hard to reach and i really dont want to wait weeks for an appointment just for a supplement. pretty much everyone i know says st johns wort is like a natural version of antidepressants so it cant be that bad, right? i just want to feel better sooner. does it actually do anything to the blood thinner or is that just a precaution?",
